### Get all rooms
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Get existing room
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/1
Accept: application/json

### Get non-existing room (Should return 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/999
Accept: application/json

### Create a valid reservation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Jan Kowalski",
  "participants": 20,
  "date": "2026-10-10"
}

### Create another valid reservation (for filtering purposes)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "reservedBy": "Anna Nowak",
  "participants": 10,
  "date": "2026-10-15"
}

### Validation Error: Missing required fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "participants": 0,
  "date": "2026-10-10"
}

### Business Rule Error: Capacity exceeded
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Piotr Wiśniewski",
  "participants": 40,
  "date": "2026-10-12"
}

### Get all reservations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Accept: application/json

### Get reservations filtered by roomId
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reservations?roomId=1
Accept: application/json

### Get reservations filtered by non-existent roomId (Should return empty array)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reservations?roomId=999
Accept: application/json

### Cancel existing reservation
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/1/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Cancel non-existing reservation (Should return 404)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/999/cancel
Accept: application/json
